{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_title", "source_sha256": "c6f61147b38c3ffb89633114fa81ed7cd3ef793e7284f6a3c6a739ff832e3edb", "ja": "ふるえるこころ", "zh": "颤抖的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bdb487cbbf65ff0b46dca6f4fe2cf2d71b731c74b29171ef8bed6320b437d322", "ja": "センターに指名された紬は、エミリー憧れの\n大和撫子。だが自分に自信が持てないせいで\n思わずエミリーを遠ざけてしまう。しかし、\nプロデューサーの後押しで仲間達と心を通わ\nせ、皆の力も借りて無事公演を成功に導く。", "zh": "被指名担任Center的䌷，是艾蜜莉憧憬的\n大和抚子。只是䌷却无法对自己抱持自信，\n因此不自觉地将艾蜜莉拒于门外。但在制作人\n的协助下，终于让䌷和同伴们相互了解，并顺\n利地借助大家的力量，让公演画下完美句点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c65772008e64a697ac3634e1df7159d81d4fd87b4671c018bf7b2f91bba45f49", "ja": "（紬の初センターの舞台が終わった。少しミスはあった\nものの、みんなの助けもあり、結果的に大成功だ！）", "zh": "（䌷的第一次Center表演结束了。尽管多少有些失误，\n但在大家的协助下，结果算得上是圆满落幕！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "30a46792c978d7a5fed07c6dd3a902c02ab461e13140f7d745e8a40078e6a163", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……ふぅ。\n…………。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……呼～\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2e59cccb802817040ea12c7ad23b46595699ccd70a3186e30c26f2edcba75cb5", "ja": "紬、お疲れさま。どうやら感想を\n聞くまでもないようだな。いい表情だ。", "zh": "䌷，辛苦啰。\n看来不用我多问了，你的表情很耀眼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ffde69f90d2467380db784bd04079fcc1ea4fa790db5f980f6a79826b8b0209f", "ja": "人の顔ばかりか心まで盗み見ておいて、よく\nそのようなしたり顔ができるものです。", "zh": "不只盯着别人的脸，还偷窥别人的心，\n真亏你能一脸得意地做出这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d2024cb1619393bf460ad176f57ad97ae6dd379f81448bb00b2a9a12c7c46b2c", "ja": "あと、満足などしていません。本番で\nいくつかステップを間違えてしまいましたし……。", "zh": "还有，我并没有满足于今天的表现。\n正式表演时跳错了好几个舞步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f6d852d4dca1ced6a13c85e45c0860b0b23f73b416126985e4084d1917be7776", "ja": "でも、気持ちはよかっただろ？", "zh": "不过，你表演得很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ea2736287bb9c9c50c323312818856bf40eff65d7e937b06f4c57c12f64e9040", "ja": "そ、それは…………。", "zh": "这、这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b2c19b3ab733cbe388f136f57aaf8df38464aba6d9a61acec169a538345dc6f", "ja": "紬さん、お疲れさまです！\nとても素晴らしい舞台でした！", "zh": "䌷姊姊，你辛苦了！\n真的是场非常精彩的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "c0b327ec10db2146f448a26a8e06822f1f6806c9e4b3ad652fbc54c370a90fd5", "ja": "ファンのみんなにもすごく喜んでもらえたわね。\n私のアダルティな魅力に、会場中がイチコロよ♪", "zh": "粉丝们也都很高兴的样子呢。\n整个会场都臣服于我的成熟魅力下了唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "d74b8fe446c4256a0c9c5d6b76e4d7c85442105f7d5d47abee5126b7fe6a91fa", "ja": "桃子も悪くなかったと思うよ。\n紬さん、センターお疲れさま。", "zh": "桃子也觉得表现得不错。\n䌷姊，你担任Center辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c9f45e544424eaedb56c81451b62fc14f18f3c75e115ecd69c4567e5130ba2f7", "ja": "みなさん……申し訳ありませんでした。\n結局本番でも、色々とご迷惑をおかけして……。", "zh": "各位……真的很抱歉。\n结果在正式上场时，还是给大家添了很多麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "20ba47d94cf11a064a95db52325981cefa62d766ce956ed9e91661bda5342952", "ja": "そんなこと気にしなくていいのに。みんなのステージ\nなんだから、持ちつ持たれつ、でしょ？", "zh": "不用放在心上啦。既然是大家一起表演，\n本来就该互相帮助不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "72e77d47378acc84272b2dd44912d36c1315c60c27487358273e05e22ee50765", "ja": "そうです！　和の心は助け合いの精神ですよ！\n紬さんのお役に立てて、私、うれしいです。", "zh": "没错！大和之心就是互助合作的精神喔！\n能帮上䌷姊姊的忙，我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "47fdbe5012576a38807b56ac6396654807461b6d25c18d5aa2f99fb8751a17bd", "ja": "みなさん……失礼いたしました。\n謝罪の言葉は、相応しくありませんでしたね。", "zh": "各位……不好意思。\n在这个场合，不适合说道歉的话呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "75a1a76e755c39d751eabcae3c4d1124dbd45feac109ff52eaf6fd4ac3d88623", "ja": "では、改めまして……。\n本日は、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "那么，请容我重来一遍……\n今天，真的非常谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "fe62f081c53767f686cda5890ab9f3ae5dc3dda75763b6994581c1ef42c731f7", "ja": "どういたしまして♪　さてと、ライブも無事終わった\nことだし、みんなで飲みに……は、いけないわね。", "zh": "不客气♪好了，既然演唱会顺利结束，\n大家一起去喝……啊，不可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "6ee7a503d7e597f19dc5b0fdd918929f005b23483b8cd18b424e4cc8547118a8", "ja": "それじゃあ、ファミレスで打ち上げをしましょう！\nね、{$P$}？", "zh": "不然大家一起去家庭餐厅庆功吧！\n可以吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a4e24530ab674dbd8d9ce122c81073ac9f4cbb74e96ba410d1f957d8e5e05317", "ja": "ええ、もちろん！　ただ、明日仕事がある子も\nいますから、軽くにしましょう。", "zh": "嗯，当然没问题！不过有些人明天还有工作，\n就简单庆祝一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "c3c043641c9b8b438c2325db712ffe1edce6d2e443b0850329618bd0152910c5", "ja": "お兄ちゃんがそこまで言うなら、桃子も行っても\nいいよ。その代わり、ホットケーキを頼んでね。", "zh": "大哥哥都这么说了，要桃子一起去也没关系喔。\n不过交换条件是要请桃子吃松饼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "9545e344e072207fc73b8eb11b375b65faec5b1dd25642d20c40a979c8a55f45", "ja": "打ち上げ楽しみですね、紬さん♪", "zh": "好期待庆功宴喔，䌷姊姊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "165c0947f22deb9002965d1d907b14784a0052d55d6cd5f43b5499aa5cae290c", "ja": "は、はい……。\nただ、私はあまり騒がしい所は、その……。", "zh": "是、是啊……\n只是我对于吵闹的地方，有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "88ea8da6c3bfcfd1e87827b7e503165791f57298bf619625aa5d4b5e8f369e38", "ja": "え……。\n紬さん、打ち上げに来ていただけないのですか？", "zh": "咦……\n䌷姊姊，你不参加庆功宴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c21af54ca371e349ed678fb1cb1bfda155b4983dcd9944b119e4ce951d774e41", "ja": "っ！　わ、わかりました。\nでは、少しだけ……。", "zh": "呜！我、我知道了。\n那就只叨扰一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "88d275382a192ef29951612355c1c8e1f4757020c261881f228c6f16c7e8271f", "ja": "Wow！　やりました！\nえへへ、今度は紬さんと一緒にお食事ですっ♪", "zh": "Wow！太好了！\n嘿嘿，这次可以和䌷姊姊一起吃饭呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b031191e1c48cae06b8ef7c0890d8a01da51863feb3e707e26057ac6747fdcd8", "ja": "エミリーさん。\n女の子が飛び跳ねるのははしたないですよ？", "zh": "艾蜜莉。\n女孩子那样蹦蹦跳跳的很不得体喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "ee969dfd886cb694db258b9e7770234433bb2fc42977af06ebff123c7a8bf239", "ja": "Oh…！　す、すみません……。", "zh": "Oh……！抱、抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "13852b750938ba6b834cfe62f2757ddec068a8fc247b61b0378205dfdede6fc5", "ja": "あら、この間と違って、すっかり\nエミリーちゃんのお姉さんって感じね？　フフッ♪", "zh": "哎呀，和之前不同，\n小䌷现在完全像是艾蜜莉的姊姊了呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f7cd7f57498b5224e7a78b3e65417201d6c4e236549f16ef1255fbaaae61b1aa", "ja": "そ、そのようなことは……。\n…………。", "zh": "才、才没这回事……\n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1029_p", "source_sha256": "19812f44dab867fb5026b62ea59c8739f8af0488e53f6009bf64cfdd700f5c9a", "ja": "（みんなと紬との間にあった少しの距離も、\n公演を通じて、確実に縮まったようだ）", "zh": "（先前存在于大家和䌷之间的那一点距离感，\n确实透过公演缩短了不少。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_004_1030_p", "source_sha256": "3501c0bed267a4336faa096f323543c549ed8f4356a8b729e5cd86c684098694", "ja": "（そのすき間がなくなるころには、きっと……\n目もくらむほど、輝く笑顔を咲かせてくれるだろう）", "zh": "（等到隔阂完全消失以后……\n䌷肯定会绽放出美到令人赞叹的耀眼笑容吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
